      en: ["Built during the 1st century AD under the Kushan Empire's rule.", "The site was accidentally discovered by a local shepherd in 1968.", "The entire monastery complex covers approximately 1.5 hectares.", "Excavations revealed murals depicting Buddha with two monks at his side.", "A sophisticated ceramic aqueduct system provided water to the site.", "UNESCO supported the restoration of the mud-brick stupa in 2004."],
